  "published": "2025-03-30T17:47:04.723Z",
  "releaseNotes": "## Version 6.4.5 - March 30, 2025\n\n  - **Added:** RuntimeIdentifier (e.g. \"win-x64\"), RuntimePlatform(e.g. \"win\"), RuntimeProcessArchitecture (e.g. \"x64\") to EnvironmentEx.\n\n  - **Improved:* Updated module intializer RegisterAssemblyResolverForDevTime to use search path with RuntimeIdentifier:\n    bin\\runtimes\\win-x64\\native\n    Also added search path with RuntimePlatform as fallback, for example osx folder can contain fat/universal dylib which works both on x64 and arm64:\n    bin\\runtimes\\win\\native\n  \n  - **Improved:* Used win-x64 and win-x86 folders instead of x64 and x86 for native files, so that we can distingush new platforms.",
  "requireLicenseAcceptance": false,
  "title": "Common Library for GleamTech Products",
